| `22_appendixF.py` | Appendix F (Tables F1–F5, Figures F1–F2) |
| `33_dml_cf.py` | Appendix Tables C6–C7, Figure C5 (runs after the clustering, whose membership it uses) |
| `30_clustering.py` | Table 7, Figure 3; Appendix B; Appendix Table F6, Figures F3–F4 |
| `31_ml.py` | Table 8, Figure 4; Appendix C (C1–C5, Figures C1–C4); Figures F5–F6, Table F7 |
| `40_granger.py` | Appendix G; Granger rows of Table 4 |
| `41_did.py` | Table 5, Figure 1; Appendix H |
